# Optional. The live endpoint is committed in src/data/site.js, so the site
# captures leads without any env var being set — Vite inlines VITE_* vars into
# the public bundle anyway, so keeping the URL "secret" bought nothing.
#
# Set this only to point a local or preview build at a different sheet, e.g.
# so test submissions don't land in the promoters' live list.
# Setup: lead-capture/README.md
VITE_LEAD_ENDPOINT=
